# Guild Challenge Advanced Specification V3

## Purpose
Define cooperative multiplayer health and fitness challenges, team synergy multipliers, and reward distributions.

## Scope
- Guild matchmaking, shared objective tracking, and collective milestone calculations.

## SSOT
- `HEALTH IS ALL/01_ARCHITECTURE/GUILD_CHALLENGE_SPEC.mdux`

## Definitions
- **Guild Synergy:** A cumulative bonus applied when all guild members complete their daily health routines.

## Runtime
- Backend cron jobs and real-time WebSocket event dispatchers.

## Rules
1. Individual health data privacy must be strictly preserved; only aggregated team scores are displayed publicly.
2. Challenge difficulties dynamically scale based on average member activity levels.

## State
- `ChallengeState`: RECRUITING | ACTIVE | EVALUATING | REWARDED

## Event
- `Event:GuildMilestoneReached`: Triggers bonus reward distribution to all active members.

## Example
- Guild members collectively achieving 100,000 total steps unlock a legendary spirit evolution catalyst.

## Exception
- Inactive members exceeding 7 days are automatically excluded from active synergy calculations.

## Related Documents
- `HEALTH IS ALL/03_BACKEND/guild_challenge_engine.py`
- `HEALTH IS ALL/lib/guild_challenge_widget.dart`

## Change History
- v3.0.0 (2026-07-31): Integrated V5 dynamic scaling and privacy controls.